1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,944
Everyone tells you to do more. More tests, more tabs, more noise.

2
00:00:04,944 --> 00:00:08,407
LakshyaPrep does the opposite. One goal. Zero noise.

3
00:00:08,407 --> 00:00:12,611
Scan. A short adaptive diagnostic shows where your points leak.

4
00:00:12,611 --> 00:00:18,296
Lock. Put in your goal score and test date, and get a week-by-week route.

5
00:00:18,296 --> 00:00:23,241
Grind. Live one-to-one sessions, drills and timed full-length mocks, re-planned every week.

6
00:00:23,241 --> 00:00:31,148
GoalGap ranks your weak skills by the points they can still give you, not by how often you miss them.

7
00:00:31,148 --> 00:00:37,204
Every miss comes back with your answer, the key, your time and the reason why.

8
00:00:37,204 --> 00:00:42,148
Practice tests run on real timing, with standard, one-and-a-half or double time.

9
00:00:42,148 --> 00:00:47,093
Land. Walk into test day with a pacing plan you've already rehearsed.

10
00:00:47,093 --> 00:00:53,919
Practice test one is free with an account. Take the free scan at lakshyaprep dot com.
